Phase 20h — the wired cost fold, first live run.

Run:      destroy stage #41  (id 31296973693)
Workflow: .github/workflows/destroy.yml, step "Price the cycle from its two
          timelines" -> scripts/fold-cost.py, then "Publish status to the
          dashboard" -> scripts/publish-status.sh

The step is continue-on-error by design (ADR-0046: a refusal must not redden a
teardown, because a red teardown holds the launch lock). Its green check is
therefore not evidence. This log is.

Taken with:
  gh run view 31296973693 --log | grep -iE "anchor|cost|price|pairing"

