Before that run, no anchor existed for stage: the clause that writes it landed
in 222dd27 at 2026-08-09T00:28Z, after the previous teardown at
2026-08-08T20:59Z. A teardown dispatched on its own would have taken the first
branch above, printed "nothing to price", and exited zero — a green run with no
cost object, which is what a broken fold would also look like.
